---
---
<section id="contacto" data-details-open="false" class="px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-16 pt-0 pb-[clamp(32px,4vw,56px)]">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto rounded-[24px] p-[clamp(24px,3vw,44px)] grid gap-[clamp(24px,3vw,44px)] items-start" style="background:#3A3A41;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr))">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-3.5 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[3px] uppercase text-white/90 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-2">Contacto</p>
      <h2 class="m-0 max-w-[20ch] text-[clamp(26px,2.9vw,38px)] font-extrabold tracking-[-1.8px] leading-[1.1] text-white">
        El diagnóstico no tiene costo.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-[46ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-white/90">Treinta minutos para ponerle número a lo que hoy estás perdiendo.</p>

      <div class="hidden sm:grid gap-3 mt-[clamp(20px,2.4vw,30px)]" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,180px),1fr))">
        <div class="bg-[rgba(240,111,203,.28)] rounded-[14px] px-[22px] py-5">
          <div class="text-[clamp(30px,3.2vw,42px)] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-2px] text-white">30 min</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-semibold text-white">Por videollamada</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/15 rounded-[14px] px-[22px] py-5">
          <div class="text-[clamp(22px,2.2vw,28px)] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-1px] text-white">Propuesta en 48 hs</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-semibold text-white/90">Si el retorno no es evidente, no avanzamos</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-white/90">Al final de la reunión te decimos con franqueza si aplica o no.</p>

      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-2 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.7] text-white/90">
        <p class="m-0">Correo: <a href="mailto:contacto@hrstrategypartners.com.ar" class="[overflow-wrap:anywhere] text-white font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 decoration-white/50 hover:decoration-white">contacto@hrstrategypartners.com.ar</a></p>
        <p class="m-0">WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+5493872289285" class="text-white font-semibold underline underline-offset-2 decoration-white/50 hover:decoration-white">+54 9 387 228-9285</a></p>
        <p class="m-0">Redes: @HRstrategypartners · @carolinavamuel</p>
        <p class="m-0">Cobertura: NOA · Argentina · Remoto LATAM</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-[20px] p-[clamp(16px,2vw,22px)]">
      <div class="px-2 pt-1 pb-3">
        <h3 class="m-0 text-[clamp(19px,1.8vw,23px)] font-bold tracking-[-.8px] text-ink">Elegí un horario</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-[1.6] text-[#5C6B8A]">Reunión por Google Meet. Confirmación automática por email.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-[14px] overflow-hidden border border-[rgba(12,22,48,.08)]">
        <iframe
          src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ1l0Zd0DmTKk3wUqRO7OeNPGj5tJBDAVCMlD9hlGSg4Tra1PTnVVfDMJCibTJlytU-ht-2Nrs66"
          title="Agendar sesión de diagnóstico inicial"
          style="border:0"
          width="100%"
          height="600"
          loading="lazy"
        ></iframe>
      </div>
      <a
        href="https://calendar.app.google/jRwr8zX5Ke4zNJD38"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="mt-3 inline-block px-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-brand-blue hover:underline"
      >¿No carga el calendario? Abrilo en una pestaña nueva →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    [data-details-open='false'] #diagnostico-detalle {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
